# Normalise line endings on commit.
#
# A teammate editing on Windows produced a 12,000-line diff across 70 files
# in which only 12 files had any real change: every other line differed only
# by a carriage return. That destroys review, makes `git blame` useless, and
# buries genuine work. Git now stores LF regardless of the editing platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.wasm binary
*.traineddata binary
*.gz binary
*.mp3 binary
